partially answered, or unresolved based on its evidence; keep\\r\\nbounded negative searches bounded, and do not describe a broad investigation\\r\\nas complete while required questions remain open.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Read only the relevant guide\\r\\n\\r\\n- Native binaries, managed assemblies, archives, and extraction:\\r\\n  [references/native-and-artifacts.md](references/native-and-artifacts.md)\\r\\n- ASARs, extracted JavaScript, feature tracing, and version comparison:\\r\\n  [references/javascript-applications.md](references/javascript-applications.md)\\r\\n- Android APK declarations, classes, methods, and static references:\\r\\n  [references/android-applications.md](references/android-applications.md)\\r\\n- Native instrumentation, debugger and process capture; browser/Electron\\r\\n  observation; static/runtime comparison:\\r\\n  [references/runtime-observation.md](references/runtime-observation.md)\\r\\n- Evidence paging, comparisons, residual unknowns, and verification:\\r\\n  [references/evidence-workflows.md](references/evidence-workflows.md)\\r\\n- Agent environments (AgentEnv bundles) of a web application, recorded from\\r\\n  a live instance or a HAR:\\r\\n  [references/environments.md](references/environments.md)\\r\\n\\r\\n## Finish the task\\r\\n\\r\\nExplain findings in plain language and tie them to returned evidence. When the\\r\\nuser asks to build something, use normal coding tools and separate observed\\r\\nbehavior from design choices. Close an opened native session with\\r\\n`close_binary` when the investigation is complete.\\r\\n\""}}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:54:32.807378+00:00", "type": "response_item", "payload": {"type": "function_call_output", "output": "[{\"type\": \"input_text\", \"text\": \"旅行奶蛙 (https://www.bilibili.com/toy/TravelMilkyFrog/index.html)\\nciteturn0view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\\\"ref_id\\\":\\\"https://www.bilibili.com/toy/TravelMilkyFrog/index.html\\\",\\\"lineno\\\":null}); Total lines: 1\\nL0: 【0†iframe†www.bilibilitoy.com】\\n\"}]"}}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:54:35.083517+00:00", "type": "response_item", "payload": {"type": "function_call_output", "output": "\"---\\r\\nname: computer-use\\r\\ndescription: Control Windows apps from ChatGPT\\r\\n---\\r\\n\\r\\n# Computer Use\\r\\n\\r\\nUse this skill to automate the UI of Microsoft Windows apps. It uses SendInput, UI Automation, and Windows.Graphics.Capture screenshots that work even when windows are occluded.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf this plugin is available, read this entire `SKILL.md` once before Windows automation work, before saying Computer Use is unavailable, and before falling back to other Windows automation.\\r\\n\\r\\nStart with the directions in the Initialize section below. Read these bundled Markdown files relative to this `SKILL.md` when you need information about the specific topic they cover:\\r\\n\\r\\n- `../../docs/guidance.md`: core runtime behavior, target-window workflow, screenshot handling, and recovery guidance. You MUST read this before controlling Windows apps.\\r\\n- `../../docs/api.md`: full `sky` API reference. Read this when you need method signatures or object shapes.\\r\\n- `../../docs/confirmations.md`: you MUST read this before deciding whether a Windows UI action needs confirmation\\r\\n\\r\\n## Initialize\\r\\n\\r\\nThe bundled `cua_node` `@oai/sky` package is the core entry point for Computer Use. Import it directly by package name from the JavaScript session. Do not spawn `codex-computer-use.exe`, search for the helper executable, or build a custom helper protocol client.\\r\\n\\r\\nRun this once per fresh `node_repl` JavaScript session:\\r\\n\\r\\n```js\\r\\nif (!globalThis.sky) {\\r\\n  const { sky } = await import(\\\"@oai/sky\\\");\\r\\n  globalThis.sky = sky;\\r\\n}\\r\\n```\\r\\n\""}}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:55:56.210063+00:00", "type": "response_item", "payload": {"type": "function_call_output", "output": "\"}}}}"}}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:56:05.145403+00:00", "type": "response_item", "payload": {"type": "function_call_output", "output": "\"}}}}"}}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:56:11.857218+00:00", "type": "response_item", "payload": {"type": "function_call_output", "output": "\"}}}}"}}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:56:18.509884+00:00", "type": "response_item", "payload": {"type": "function_call_output", "output": "\"}}}}"}}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:56:25.397632+00:00", "type": "response_item", "payload": {"type": "function_call_output", "output": "\"}}}}"}}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:56:36.126172+00:00", "type": "response_item", "payload": {"type": "function_call_output", "output": "\"}}}}"}}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:56:41.061543+00:00", "type": "response_item", "payload": {"type": "function_call_output", "output": "{\"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Completion summary received.\"}], \"isError\": false}"}}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-12T06:57:58.602391+00:00", "type": "response_item", "payload": {"type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "我看了你发的[《旅行奶蛙》网页](https://www.bilibili.com/toy/TravelMilkyFrog/index.html)，实际查看了家园、行李准备和旅行图鉴。它已经包含钱草采集、兴趣物与补给、27 段旅行回忆、重复卡兑换、家园添置等系统；我没有完成一整趟旅行，回程体验暂时只能依据界面说明判断。\n\n**我建议 MVP 只围绕一件事：让玩家对这只小家伙产生牵挂，愿意回来看看它带回了什么。**\n\n核心循环可以定为：\n\n**收资源 → 准备行李 → 出门旅行 → 离线等待 → 归来收明信片 → 再准备下一次。**\n\n首版我建议保留这些功能，数量是建议的开发范围：\n\n| 功能 | MVP 做到什么程度 | 为什么需要 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 小屋与角色 | 1 个小屋、1 只角色；有待机、吃饭、睡觉等简单表现 | 角色要让人觉得“它在生活”，这是陪伴感的来源 |\n| 资源采集 | 1 种货币、1 块定时恢复的采集区域 | 给玩家回来时一个立即能做的小动作 |\n| 简单商店 | 3 种食物，直接购买 | 提供轻量选择，也让资源有用途 |\n| 行李准备 | 首版只放 1 个食物槽；不同食物影响旅行时长或目的地倾向 | 玩家需要感觉自己的准备影响了旅程 |\n| 旅行与归来 | 在家、旅行中、已归来三个主要状态；关闭网页后仍能到点归来 | 完成放置玩法的核心 |\n| 明信片奖励 | 3 类目的地、共 9～12 张明信片；每张配一句旅行见闻 | 给等待一个有情绪价值的回报 |\n| 收藏相册 | 能查看已获得的明信片、地点和收集进度 | 留下成长记录，产生下一次旅行的目标 |\n| 存档与引导 | 本地自动存档；简短引导完成第一次旅行 | 刷新不丢进度，第一次玩得懂 |\n\n其中，**明信片和角色表现值得多花一点心思**。同样是拿到一张图，“获得森林明信片 ×1”和“它在树荫下坐了一下午，还分了半块饭团给松鼠”，带来的期待感会很不一样。\n\n首版的节奏，我建议这样试：\n\n- **第一次旅行 1～2 分钟**，让玩家当场体验完整循环。\n- 后续先试 **15～30 分钟的短途旅行**，方便早期测试，再依据反馈调整。\n- 每次归来保证有一段回忆；重复明信片先显示获得次数即可。\n- 食物影响目的地的概率，保留一点随机性，让准备有意义、结果有惊喜。\n- 离线回来时结算这一趟旅行，暂时不做自动连续出游。\n\n**这些系统可以明确放到后续版本：**稀有度与保底、重复卡兑换、复杂配装、家园装修、制作系统、好友来访、排行榜、任务与签到、付费和广告。云存档也可以等公开测试时再加；最早的可玩原型用本地存档就够了。\n\n界面上也可以压到很小：**一张小屋主场景，加“商店、行李、相册”三个弹窗，以及一个归来奖励展示**。暂时无需做横向大地图或多个可探索房间。\n\n这一版做完后，找一小批玩家重点观察三件事：\n\n1. 不靠口头解释，能否完成第一次出行。\n2. 收到第一张明信片后，是否主动准备第二次旅行。\n3. 过一段时间后，是否会自己回来看看。\n\n如果玩家愿意开始第二趟、也会惦记着回来，才值得继续扩充内容。**我会把首版定在“1 只角色＋1 个家＋3 种食物＋3 类目的地＋约 12 张明信片＋完整离线旅行与存档”这个范围。**这个体量已经足够验证核心体验。"}]}}], "quota_cache": {"account_key": "daa05e974ef2fc5badc563e7", "cached_at": 1794466677.308027, "quota": {"time": "2026-11-12T06:57:57.308027+00:00", "windows": [{"slot": "primary", "minutes": 300.0, "reset": 1794483481, "remaining": 93}, {"slot": "secondary", "minutes": 10080.0, "reset": 1794576398, "remaining": 43}], "source": "live", "account_key": "daa05e974ef2fc5badc563e7"}}}